{{Quote|Relying on natural instinct, Humans stay versatile and responsive in any fight.}}
'''Human''' is one of the four [[races]] that players can spawn with on joining the game for the first time. It has a 62.5% chance to be granted upon first joining the game, making it the most common race obtainable through this method. 

Human mainly supports damage and mobility. Due to high damage increases, Human can assist the player greatly when they wish to perform one-shot combos, and allows for an aggressive playstyle. However, mastering this race is not easy because it does not provide any defense.

